Rs 524 crore and participated in several project bids. Additionally, construction progressed on various projects including the Indore and Patna Metro.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/earnings/hcc-q2-profit-slumps-53-to-rs-22-crore/articleshow/135599840.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135599840,imgsize-2261832.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/earnings/hcc-q2-profit-slumps-53-to-rs-22-crore/articleshow/135599840.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 13:40:34 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[India’s new wealth rituals: What are millennials and Gen Z buying on Dhanteras?]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Dhanteras investing is evolving from physical gold purchases toward diversified digital portfolios. Younger investors are embracing gold ETFs, mutual funds, Bitcoin and tokenised assets while retaining the festival’s core goal of building wealth and financial security patiently.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/indias-new-wealth-rituals-what-are-millennials-and-gen-z-buying-on-dhanteras/articleshow/135596463.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135596463,imgsize-209346.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/indias-new-wealth-rituals-what-are-millennials-and-gen-z-buying-on-dhanteras/articleshow/135596463.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 11:51:45 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Beyond gold: What $340 billion in crypto flows says about India's investment preferences this Dhanteras]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Gold remains central to Indian household savings, but high prices are pushing investors toward ETFs and digital gold instead of physical holdings. Crypto is emerging as a separate portfolio option rather than replacing gold, reflecting a broader shift toward digital ownership and diversification.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/beyond-gold-what-340-billion-in-crypto-flows-says-about-indias-investment-preferences-this-dhanteras/articleshow/135596165.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135596165,imgsize-211266.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/beyond-gold-what-340-billion-in-crypto-flows-says-about-indias-investment-preferences-this-dhanteras/articleshow/135596165.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 11:37:20 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Largecap dhamaka! 6 bluechip stocks with upside of up to 48% to buy this Diwali]]> </title><description><![CDATA[As Samvat 2083 approaches, careful stock selection is vital due to global uncertainties. Religare Broking identifies six largecap stocks, such as Bajaj Finance and Mahindra Mahindra, that show promising upside this Diwali. With each stock displaying unique growth characteristics supporting their projected price targets, analysts stress the importance of sustainable earnings growth. A diversified portfolio is essential for effectively navigating the changing market dynamics. ]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/largecap-dhamaka-6-bluechip-stocks-with-upside-of-up-to-48-to-buy-this-diwali/slideshow/135595530.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135595320,imgsize-89118.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/largecap-dhamaka-6-bluechip-stocks-with-upside-of-up-to-48-to-buy-this-diwali/slideshow/135595530.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 11:01:12 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Maxwell Engineering shares list at 90% premium. Here's how HGS, other 2 SME issues debuted]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Maxwell Engineering Solutions, HGS (India), Vectras Enprocon, and Johnsoncab Electricals recently marked their presence on the sto